    "traveller: it walks those [east, north] points in turn, there and back (or round, if the",
    "route ends where it starts), resting at each end. 'night': true keeps a group away by day: it comes out",
    "after dusk and leaves at dawn (WLD-11), never within 50 m of Rowan or in the middle of a fight."
